<title>UK: Household Finance Corp sets 1.5 bln FFR bond.</title>
<headline>Household Finance Corp sets 1.5 bln FFR bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.48    PAY DATE    30 APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.855    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX/PAR   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2007 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
